[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_17]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_17_desc]
“Muffinology” - Presented by Duchess of Cloudsdale, Derpy Hooves\nLecture Eight, Non-Edible Uses of Muffins

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_17_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about muffins, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_17_TRUE_TOOLTIP]
Unlock decisons in §YMuffins!§!: §YMuffins 4 Farm§! and §YMuffins 4 Arsenal§!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_17_FALSE_TOOLTIP]
Make decisions §YMuffins 4 Farm§! and §YMuffins 4 Arsenal§! in §YMuffins§! disappear.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_17]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_17_desc]
《马芬学讲座》——主讲者，云中城公爵，呆蹄\n第八节，论马芬的非食用用途

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_17_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于马芬的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_17_TRUE_TOOLTIP]
解锁§Y马芬！§!中的决议：§Y马芬换农场§! 和 §Y马芬换军工§!。

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_17_FALSE_TOOLTIP]
让§Y马芬！§!中的§Y马芬换农场§! 和 §Y马芬换军工§!决议消失。

